<translate>
==== FatigueChange ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Used for food. Indicates how much fatigue the food will take away. If the number is negative, fatigue will decrease, if it is positive, it will increase.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
FatigueChange = -50,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

